{
  "about": "Text decorations and the whitespace a canvas run ends in. `decorations`: each case is drawn on a canvas twice, plain and with `textDecoration` set to each of `lines`, in `font` with `letterSpacing` of `spacing` px, aligned `align` at `anchor[align]` in direction `dir` for each of `layouts`; the columns where the two draws differ are the decoration, and they are exactly floor(start) to ceil(start + width), width being measureText`s and start where the alignment puts the advance -- the anchor, less all of the width for `right` and half of it for `center`, in either direction. `inkBoxes`: measureText`s actualBoundingBoxLeft and actualBoundingBoxRight for right-to-left runs of text ending in whitespace, which stands at the visual start of the run. `paragraphs`: the same for the Paragraph API, which says what it holds. Read by tests/native_context2d.rs and tests/suite/text.test.js.",
